            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h2",
              "content": "Who is Olivia Korosak?"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Olivia Korosak is an award-winning Canadian composer for film, orchestras and ensembles as well as a sound designer for theatre. Trained in piano and voice from age four, she graduated with highest honours from McMaster University in Music and Classical Voice. She is a member of the Screen Composers Guild of Canada and the Association of Canadian Women Composers."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "paddingTop": "l",
          "paddingTopLarge": "2xl",
          "tag": "figure",
          "content": [
