    {
      "renderType": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "paddingTop": "l",
      "paddingTopLarge": "2xl",
      "content": [
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "maxWidth": "xs",
          "richTextStyles": true,
          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h2",
              "content": "The Project"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Redesign and develop Olivia's portfolio site to better showcase her work and migrate it from WordPress to a static site built with Contentful on Cloudflare Workers."
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h3",
              "content": "The Brief"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Context"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Olivia's site was coming up for renewal at a higher cost and its custom WordPress theme had become limiting. Compositions were tracks grouped by a category standing in for its project, all on a single archive page. This made it hard to add detail to a project and as the page grew, so did its load time. Credits, performances and scoring were later added as separate pages, disconnected from the rest of her work. Having designed and built the original site myself, it was also a chance to revisit my own work and improve on it as a designer and developer."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "paddingTop": "l",
          "paddingTopLarge": "2xl",
          "paddingBottom": "l",
          "paddingBottomLarge": "2xl",
          "tag": "figure",
          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "container",
              "maxWidth": "s",
              "paddingTop": "m",
              "content": [
                {
                  "renderType": "container",
                  "layout": "row",
                  "gap": "m",
                  "gapLarge": "l",
                  "align": "center",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "renderType": "column",
                      "widthSmall": "6",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "renderType": "image",
                          "image": "olivia-korosak/pre-work-1"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "renderType": "column",
                      "widthSmall": "6",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "renderType": "image",
                          "image": "olivia-korosak/pre-work-2"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "renderType": "container",
              "tag": "figcaption",
              "content": "Pre-migration desktop work page, a single page displaying projects and tracks."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "maxWidth": "xs",
          "richTextStyles": true,
          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Goals"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "ul",
              "content": [
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": "Organize work more clearly for prospective clients and content editors"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": "Reduce hosting cost and move to faster, more flexible hosting"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": "Improve page load time on homepage and work pages (~2-4 seconds)"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "renderType": "container",
      "tag": "section",
      "paddingTop": "l",
      "paddingTopLarge": "2xl",
      "content": [
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "maxWidth": "xs",
          "richTextStyles": true,
          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h2",
              "content": "The Process"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h3",
              "content": "Visual Redesign"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "The redesign started with rethinking the information architecture of the work content type, bringing everything together under "
                },
                {
                  "tag": "strong",
                  "content": "work"
                },
                {
                  "content": " as one place to explore and to point prospective clients to."
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "ul",
              "content": [
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Flexible projects: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "projects can be a composition, credit, score or any other project type, with or without tracks."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Flexible tracks: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "tracks are now their own content type, assignable to a specific project and/or genre."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Better wayfinding: "
                    },
                    {
                      "content": "breadcrumbs throughout make it easier to navigate and explore related work."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
